or a whole piece of this redness, swelling, heat and pain

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:17.684
Because gout and cellulitis

00:10:17.684 --> 00:10:19.552
look a lot like each other.

00:10:19.552 --> 00:10:22.622
So the doctor's first impression

00:10:22.622 --> 00:10:25.992
think this redness, swelling, heat and pain is gout.

00:10:25.992 --> 00:10:28.027
But cellulitis is an infection

00:10:28.027 --> 00:10:29.929
Anti-infective treatment

00:10:29.929 --> 00:10:32.966
Wrong treatment will prolong the disease, right?

00:10:32.966 --> 00:10:35.435
So don't think that the old gout problem is coming back.

00:10:35.435 --> 00:10:36.903
Then I judged

00:10:36.903 --> 00:10:37.904
Or talk to your doctor.

00:10:37.904 --> 00:10:39.239
I have gout.

00:10:39.239 --> 00:10:42.008
We who study Chinese medicine look at these things

00:10:42.008 --> 00:10:44.010
We must make a good diagnosis

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.413
Treatment is effective

00:10:47.413 --> 00:10:50.350
